# Shared direct package pins for the independent CPU oracle. The interpreter
# guard requires Python 3.10.11 on Windows or Python 3.10.12 on Linux. The
# resolved requirements-reference.txt lock is Linux x86_64 evidence; resolve
# this direct file in an isolated owner-managed environment on Windows.
# The CPU index and local-version suffix prevent an accidental CUDA Torch install.
